# --- GSD runtime (installed tooling, not source) ---
# Reinstall on a new host with:
#   npx -y @opengsd/gsd-core@1.11.0 --claude --local
# Tracked and intentionally NOT ignored: .claude/CLAUDE.md, .codex/config.toml, .planning/**
